OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA mostly dry day with variable
OL,6,Famounts of cloud and a few sunnier
OL,7,Fbreaks at times. Chance of the odd
OL,8,Fdrizzly shower. Light mainly
OL,9,Fsouthwesterly winds.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FA mostly dry evening and
OL,12,Fnight with variable amounts of cloud
OL,13,Fand some clear periods. The odd
OL,14,Fdrizzly shower at times. Light and
OL,15,Fvariable winds.
OL,16,
OL,17,CThursday:FLittle change, mainly dry
OL,18,Fand settled with just the odd light
OL,19,Fand drizzly shower. Light winds.
